import Reef.Main

/-!
# A bioluminescent reef

The demo's modules: `Reef.Platform` (its options and window), `Reef.Gpu`
(help with the GPU), `Reef.Math` (vectors and matrices), `Reef.Camera` (the
camera), `Reef.App` (the state, and what changes it), `Reef.Shaders` (the
WGSL, written from `shaders/` by the build), `Reef.Render` (drawing),
`Reef.Overlay` and `Reef.Stats` (the text over it) and `Reef.Main` (the
program).
-/
